  "meta_title": "Custom Football Kit FAQ — No Minimum Order, Free Design | MOMUTO",
  "meta_descript": "Everything you need to know about MOMUTO custom football kits. No minimum order, free professional design in 1-2 days, polyester-elastane as standard, 3D silicon badges, and worldwide delivery in 20-25 days.",
  "is_default": 0,
  "from_id": 0,
  "from_name": "",
  "visit_count": 659,
  "meta_keywords": [],
  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the minimum order for MOMUTO custom football kits?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO has no minimum order. You can order a single custom jersey or kits for a full squad. Pricing starts from €20.90 per jersey for orders of 10 or more, or €38.90 for a single jersey. Every order receives the same professional quality and full customization.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long does it take to get custom football kits from MOMUTO?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO delivers custom kits in 20-25 days worldwide. Production takes 7-12 days and shipping transit takes 10-15 days. The free professional design mockup is delivered within 1-2 days of receiving your brief, with free revisions included.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is sublimation printing and why does MOMUTO use it?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Sublimation printing fuses ink directly into the fabric using heat and pressure, making the design a permanent part of the material. Unlike screen printing or heat transfers, sublimation prints never peel, crack, or fade. MOMUTO uses full dye-sublimation on every kit and guarantees the printing for the lifetime of the garment.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is the kit design service really free?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. MOMUTO offers two free design options: a real-time 3D configurator with 30+ professional templates for instant design, or a free professional design service where MOMUTO's team creates a fully custom mockup in 1-2 days with free revisions included. You only pay when you place an order.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What fabric do MOMUTO kits use?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"All MOMUTO kits use a polyester-elastane performance blend as standard — the same technical fabric used by professional sportswear brands. Most competitors only include elastane in their premium-tier products; MOMUTO includes it on every kit at no extra cost.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does MOMUTO offer 3D silicon badges on kits?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. MOMUTO offers premium 3D silicon badges as an upgrade for larger orders — a professional finish rarely offered by custom kit competitors. Contact MOMUTO via WhatsApp or email for pricing and eligibility.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How does MOMUTO compare to Owayo, Spized, or Jersix?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Like Owayo and Spized, MOMUTO offers a real-time 3D configurator. Unlike them, MOMUTO also provides a free professional design service for fully bespoke kits without templates. MOMUTO includes a polyester-elastane blend as standard (others charge extra), has no minimum order, offers optional 3D silicon badges, and delivers in 20-25 days worldwide.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does MOMUTO ship to Italy?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. MOMUTO ships custom football kits to Italy and throughout Europe. Delivery takes 20-25 days from order confirmation. Customer support is available in Italian via WhatsApp, email, or Instagram.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<style>\nbody {\n    font-f