h2>\n<div class=\"app_faqtool_wrap\" faqtool_id=\"424\"></div>\n<h2 class=\"h2\">7. Product and Care</h2>\n<div class=\"app_faqtool_wrap\" faqtool_id=\"425\"></div>\n</div>",
